# 16. DEPLOYMENT ARCHITECTURE

## 16.1 Environments

Maintain four distinct environments (D-08):

1. Local development.
2. Automated testing (ephemeral, CI-run).
3. Staging.
4. Production.

Each environment must have independently managed configuration and credentials, and
its own database, auth, and storage. Never use production credentials for ordinary
development or testing, and never connect local or staging to production resources.

